---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
    title="Terms & Conditions — TipSplit" 
    description="Read the terms and conditions for using TipSplit. Free, open-source tip pooling calculations."
>
    <main class="app-container relative z-10 max-w-(--max-width) mx-auto px-4 py-6 sm:px-6 sm:py-10 pb-12">
        <!-- Back Link -->
        <a href="/" class="back-link">
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
                <path d="M10 13L5 8l5-5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
            </svg>
            Back to Calculator
        </a>

        <!-- Content Card -->
        <section class="card static-card bg-bg-card border border-border rounded-lg p-6 sm:p-8 static-content">
            <h1>Terms & Conditions</h1>
            <p>Last updated: August 11, 2026</p>
            
            <p>Welcome to TipSplit. By accessing or using our website, you agree to comply with and be bound by the following terms and conditions.</p>

            <h2>1. Acceptable Use</h2>
            <p>TipSplit is provided as a free calculator utility for personal, restaurant, or business calculations. You agree to use this site only for lawful purposes and in a manner that does not infringe the rights of, restrict, or inhibit anyone else's use and enjoyment of the website.</p>

            <h2>2. Disclaimer of Accuracy & Warranties</h2>
            <p>The calculations and reports generated by TipSplit are for informational and general estimation purposes only. While we strive to ensure the math and logic are correct, <strong>TipSplit does not warrant or guarantee the accuracy, completeness, or suitability of calculations for payroll, taxation, or official accounting purposes</strong>.</p>
            <p>You are solely responsible for double-checking calculations and ensuring that your tip pooling distributions comply with your local, state, and federal labor regulations (such as US Department of Labor tip pool rules).</p>

            <h2>3. Limitation of Liability</h2>
            <p>In no event shall TipSplit, its creators, or contributors be liable for any direct, indirect, incidental, special, or consequential damages (including, but not limited to, payroll discrepancies, labor disputes, lost profits, tax audit penalties, or accounting errors) arising out of or in connection with the use or inability to use this site, even if advised of the possibility of such damage.</p>

            <h2>4. No Warranties</h2>
            <p>This website is provided "as is" and "as available" without any representations or warranties, express or implied. We do not guarantee that the site will always be available, secure, or free from bugs or errors.</p>

            <h2>5. Intellectual Property</h2>
            <p>The code, layouts, custom design assets, and logos are the property of TipSplit and are protected by applicable copyright laws. You may copy, fork, or reuse the calculator for non-commercial or development purposes under open-source license standards, where applicable.</p>

            <h2>6. Governing Law</h2>
            <p>These terms and conditions are governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of the United States. Any disputes relating to these terms shall be subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of the competent courts.</p>
        </section>

        <!-- Footer -->
        <footer class="footer text-center mt-8 pt-5">
            <nav class="footer-links flex justify-center gap-4 text-[0.75rem] font-medium text-text-secondary mb-3.5" aria-label="Footer Navigation">
                <a href="/about" class="hover:text-accent transition-colors duration-150 no-underline">About Us</a>
                <span class="text-text-muted" aria-hidden="true">•</span>
                <a href="/privacy" class="hover:text-accent transition-colors duration-150 no-underline">Privacy Policy</a>
                <span class="text-text-muted" aria-hidden="true">•</span>
                <a href="/terms" class="hover:text-accent transition-colors duration-150 no-underline">Terms & Conditions</a>
                <span class="text-text-muted" aria-hidden="true">•</span>
                <a href="/contact" class="hover:text-accent transition-colors duration-150 no-underline">Contact Us</a>
            </nav>
            <p class="text-text-muted text-[0.78rem] mb-3">TipSplit · 100% Free & Private Calculator</p>
        </footer>
    </main>
</Layout>
